      "r011": "Anyway, the budget. The class gets five thousand yen.",
      "r012": "Nobuhara pulls the microphone closer. His delivery abruptly turns grave.",
      "r013": "Five thousand yen in Showa 40 is equivalent to fifty thousand yen today.",
      "r014": "When did we jump back to Showa 40?",
      "r015": "What if we sell coffee for a hundred yen a cup?",
