      "r025": "Then it will be an educational presentation.",
      "r026": "What if we serve tea while presenting the history of cafés?",
      "r027": "Start with a menu.",
      "r028": "I pick up my bag. The form goes into it too.",
      "r029": "The paper! Do not take the paper home!",
      "r030": "But I can go?",
      "r031": "Right. Whoever wins mahjong picks the attraction. Settled.",
      "r032": "Why are we settling this with mahjong?",
      "r033": "Because talking isn’t getting us anywhere.",
      "r034": "Isamu, grab that desk!",
      "r035": "One side of the desk rises before I can answer.",
      "r036": "…I have not agreed to this.",
      "r037": "I am the commentator. I will get the equipment.",
      "r038": "This was your idea.",
      "r039": "Can I take some photos of the preparations?",
      "r040": "Mahiru is in! One more!",
      "r041": "Photos…",
      "r042": "What attraction do you want?",
