      "r053": "Are we being invaded, or failing an English test?",
      "r054": "The grammar is part of the charm.",
      "r055": "Kotoha rewinds it. Her shoulders shake.",
      "r056": "You have already seen it.",
      "r057": "Just once more.",
      "r058": "In the next file, rows of badgers bounce in time. A mushroom interrupts them. Then a snake. Then the badgers start again.",
      "r059": "Wait, we’re back at the badgers. Does this thing ever end?",
      "r060": "Just wait. The snake is coming back.",
      "r061": "So, anything we can use on the poster?",
      "r062": "…I saved three videos.",
      "r063": "She opens the download folder. No poster images. Just three video files.",
      "r064": "“ending.mp4”? That’ll do for the end of my commentary, right?",
      "r065": "Watch it before you decide that.",
      "r066": "Not that one, please. The ending is awful.",
      "r067": "Sure, sure.",
      "r068": "Will you join us? We need a fourth.",
      "r069": "…All right. I’ll watch the rest later.",
      "r070": "Back in the classroom, a green mat spans two desks. Nobuhara is using our submission form as a commentary-desk mat.",
      "r071": "I want that paper back afterwards.",
      "r072": "All three ron claims count at this table. Chombo costs a mangan payment. Agreed?",
      "r073": "Just deal already!",
      "r074": "Kotoha calls pon. For an instant, the corner of an exposed tile seems to glint.",
      "r075": "Hey, did that tile just flash?",
      "r076": "Without answering, Kotoha calls pon again. Nobuhara’s commentary grows more cautious as her concealed hand gets shorter.",
