      "r145": "Nobuhara smooths his fringe with a finger, then reaches for the tile wall with both hands.",
      "r146": "Gamblers tell lies…",
      "r147": "The row of wall tiles Nobuhara has lifted slides toward his own hand.",
      "r148": "Were you just trying to switch your hand with the wall?",
