      "r186": "It means don’t bump the thread. Somehow even posting has homework.",
      "r187": "“Post faces. That can be your entire attraction.” …I see.",
      "r188": "Don’t take that one seriously.",
      "r278": "We bring the replies back to the classroom and connect the display. We have far more photos of our preparations than actual ideas.",
      "r189": "I put the posts and all our photos together.",
      "r190": "Apparently nobody reads to the end of a wall of text. Let’s make an explainer video.",
